1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
YouTube on your PS5. With zero ads.
Here is the whole setup.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,200
Firmware 8.20. The YouTube app you
already own. Nothing else needed.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:15,000
One file — ytps5.elf. Add it in Payload
Manager like any other payload.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Put it in autoload, so you only do this
once. It lasts until the next full reboot.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Run it. It waits for the YouTube app,
then patches it in memory.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
That is it. No package to install.
No second app. No app replacement.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,400
Open YouTube exactly like before.

8
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:48,100
Pick any video. No pre-roll, no mid-roll.
Sponsor segments skip themselves.

9
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:54,100
Settings live inside the app: Ad Block
and SponsorBlock, both on.

10
00:00:54,100 --> 00:01:03,000
And it is not tied to one app version.
Edit config.txt to pick which YouTube
build gets patched.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,800
Free, open source, one file.
Link in the description.
